...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
team: Product Intelligence Team { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI API { class: ext }
launch: Product Launch Analyst { class: ours }

user -> ui: 회사명 입력 + Analyze Competitor Strategy 클릭
ui -> team: team.run(불릿 생성 프롬프트)
team -> openai: 리더 모델 호출 + 위임 도구 스키마
openai -> team: "tool_call delegate_task_to_member(Launch Analyst)"
team -> launch: 위임 실행 (launch.run(task))
